    title: 'LinkedIn Pinpoint Tips for Beginners: Everything I Wish I Knew Starting Out',
    description: 'Starting LinkedIn Pinpoint? Here are the practical tips and common mistakes to avoid, written by someone who learned the hard way so you do not have to.',
